DESCRIPTION:Hailing from Lafayette\, Louisiana\, and rooted deep in Cajun c
 ulture\, Troy Richard serves up his own unique blend of musical gumbo. Bri
 nging together a rich mix of sounds\, influences\, and Louisiana flavor\, 
 Troy delivers a solo performance that is as authentic and soulful as the r
 oots he comes from.\n\nBest known as a member of The Richard Revue\, Troy 
 steps out on his own to showcase his musical versatility and personality i
 n a more intimate setting. With a sound steeped in South Louisiana traditi
 on and a style all his own\, he brings a little something for everyone.\n\
 nFrom the heart of Acadiana to the stage\, Troy Richard brings the flavor\
 , the soul\, and the spirit of Louisiana to every performance. Come hungry
